<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id">Nahum</book>
  <para style="h">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nahum</para>
  <para style="mt">Nahum</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himi hi Elkosh khuami Nahum in Nineveh khua thuhla ah langnak a hmuh mi a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu thiiknei le phuhlam hmang Pathian a si; Bawipa cu phuhlam hmang le thinheng thei a si. Amah a dodaltu parah phu a hlam ih, A ral pawl parah thinheng in a lehrul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa cu olte in a thin a heng lo; Asinain a huham cu a nasa ngaingai. Misual pawl hrem loin a luatter hrimhrim lo ding. Bawipa ih fehnak kipah phusiing le thlipi a tho ih, Mero cu a ke fehnak ihsin a thomi leikhu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tifinriat thu a pek ih a kanter, Tiva hmuahhmuah khal an caar an ro ṭheh. Bashan ram le Karmel tlang tla an ro ṭheh ih, Lebanon tlang ih pangpar khal an vuai ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlang saangpipi a hmaiah an hnin ih, Tlang niamtete an cim ṭheh. A hmaika ahcun leilung le a parih ummi pawl cu, An khur ih an ṭhia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thinhengnak hmaiah zoso a ding thei ding? A thin ai-thoknak cu zoso a tuar thei ding? A thinhengnak cu tisa bangin a burh, A hmaika ahcun lungto hman leivutah an cang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa cu a ṭha, Harsatnak caanah beunak ṭha bik a si. A hnenih humhimnak a hawltu cu a zaangfah ih, Himdamnak an ngah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tilian in thil a siatsuah bangin, A ral pawl cu a siatsuah ih, A dodaltu pawl cu thihnak khawthim sungah a thlak hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ziangah so Bawipa cu a phiar nan tum rero? A lo siatsuah ṭheh hai ding a si. Zohman in voihnih tiang an do ngam dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hling le so an ngerh awk ṭheh bangin an ngerh aw; Zu phaam pawl bangin an ri ih, Hramro bangin an kaang ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Nineveh, na sungin misual pakhat Bawipa dodaltu le midang thusual forhtu a suak zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel mi hnenah, “Assiria mi an tamzet ding ih an cakzet ding naón, Siatsuah an si dingih an cem ding. Ka minung pawl, ka lo hrem zo ih Ka lo hrem sal nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lo delhtu kawn cu ka khiak ding, A lo ṭemṭawntu thir cikcin cu ka phihcat ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Assiria hrangah Bawipa ih thupekmi cu: “Na hmin sawngtu dingah tefa na nei nawn lo ding; Na khawzing biakinn ihsin na milem le an zuk pawl cu ka khuai ṭheh ding. Na thlaan cu atu ihsin ka timtuah cia ding ih, Nung tlak na si nawn lo,” ti hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tlangpar ah thuthangṭha a phurtu le daihnak a rak thlentu ih ke khi zohhnik uh! Maw Judah, na tuah dingmi puai cu tuah aw, Na thukammi cu kimter aw. Mi ṭha lo pawl cun an lo neh nawn lo ding, Annih cu siatsuah ṭheh an si zo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Nineveh, a lo siatsuahtu dingin a lo do; Raldonak ruhkulh in rak bawh uh; Lamzin zoh ṭha uh, nan hnipuan fektein hruk uh. Nan cahnak le nan thazaang suah thluh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siatsuahtu pawl in an thilri an ram ih an siatsuah ṭheh zo naón Bawipa in Judah le Israel sunlawinak cu a pe sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An ral miralṭha pawl ih ralphaw cu a sen; An ralkap pawl cu senlaar in an thuam aw; An rangleng pawl raldo dingah artlang ih an tiar awk tikah cun, Meisa tleu vekin an tleu. An rang pawl cu an dungke hnih in an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An rangleng pawl cu khawsung lamzin kaupi ah an pet ciamco; Misenpi tonnak hmunah suk le so ah an khir; Meisa hlio vek an si, Nimthlakau vekin an tle zukzo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hleice ih hrilmi ral bawi pawl an ko, An nawt awknak ah an bah phahphah. Khawpi kulhnak phardawl lamah an tlan, Ral pawl in phardawl ihsin an run den tikah, A khamnak zamrang in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tiva lam kapih kotka pawl cu bal ṭheh an si; Siangpahrang inn cu ṭihphannak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawinu an kai, A sal pawl cun thuro uuk bangin an ṭah; An riahsia in an awm an cuum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tivapi an kham ih an dawlnak a pah bangin, Nineveh khawlipi sung in milai an suak ciamco. “Tlan hlah uh, tlan hlah uh,” tiah an au, Asinain zohman an kir duh cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngun pawl ram ṭheh uh, Sui pawl la ṭheh uh; Hi khawlipi cu hlawnthil in a khat ih cem ni a nei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nineveh cu siatsuah ṭheh a si zo, Tlansan mi le ramṭhing ah a cang zo. Mi thinlung a nau ih, An khuk a ṭhia, an tha a cem, An hmai a raam ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuiah so khawpi cu a um? Kiosa kua vek a si mi khawpi, Kiosa thuangte cawmnak hmun, Kiosacang le a pinu an fehnak hmun, Kiosa note tla an himnak khawpi cu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kiosacang in sa a deh, A keu ih a bauhthlek ṭheh, A pinu le a fanote pawl hrangah, A kua cu bauhthlekmi sa in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Keimah hi nan ral ka si. Nan rangleng pawl ka ur ṭheh ding. Ral kutah nan ralkap pawl an thi ding. Midang hnen ihsin nan lakmi cu nan hnen ihsin ka lak sal ṭheh ding. Na palai pawl ih ngenmi cu zohman in an thei nawn lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi khawpi cu a cem a si, Mi bumnak le mi thahnak in a khat mi khawpi, Mi thilri lonnak le ramnak in a khatmi khawpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngaihnik uh, an rang vuak thawm, An rangleng ke ring thawm, An rang ke vuak thawm, An rangleng tlan thawm durdo cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rang ralkap pawl in an nam hai, An ralnam an lek zukzo, an feipi a tle zurhzo. Miruak cu a thuah in an thuah aw, Siar cawk lo miruak cu! Ruak parah milai an bah rero!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hlawhhlangnu Nineveh cu hremnak a tuar; Duh thlala a si ih iang a nei; Asinain a iang neihnak cun tur a nei. Miphun tampi a thlem ih, Sal ah a tuah hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Maw Nineveh, keimah hi na ral ka si; Na hni ka lo hlit ṭheh ding ih na hmai ka lo khuh ding; Miphun pawl in na taklawngte ih na um kha an lo hmu ding; Ram uknak pawl in na mualphonak an lo hmu ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nautatnak thawn ka lo zoh ding, Mi ih fihmi ah ka lo tuah ding; Mi in mangbang in an lo zoh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lo hmutu pawl cu an com dukdi ding ih, ‘Nineveh a siat ṭheh zo e, Zotal ih zaangfah a tong maw? Hnemtu ding zotal an um maw?’ an ti ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nineveh, Izipt khawpi Thebes hnakin na ṭhadeuh cuang maw? Thebes khal cun phar bangin mi humtu tiva a nei - Nail tiva pi cu a hrangah a ṭanhmun khuarnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah in Ethiopia le Izipt ram a uk; a cahnak cu cem ti a nei lo; Put le Libia khal amah ṭantu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Thebes mi pawl khal sal kaihmi an si ih an hruai hlo. Lamzin kel kipah an faale pawl cu an vuak that. An mi upa le bawi deuhdeuh pawl cu thir cikcin khit tahratin an hruai ih anmah kaitu lakah camcawhfung zukin an zem ih an ṭhekdarh ṭheh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nineveh, nang khal na ri ve ding ih zianghman thei loin na tlu ding ih na ral pawl kut sung ihsin luat na tum ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ralhruang pawl cu a rah a hmin zetmi theipi kung vek an si: Theipi kung cu hnin awla a rah cu a eitu ka sungah an rung tla ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na ralkap pawl cu nunau vek an si; na ral pawl hmaiah na ram cu zohman ṭantu nei loin a um. Na kotka kharnak kothrolh pawl cu meisa in a kaang ṭheh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ral in an lo kulh ding ruangah tidai rak khai cia aw; na ralhruang le na ruhkulh pawl hngetkhoh deuh in rak tuah aw. Tlakrawh hrangah tlak rak pal cia awla, tlakrawh ahnak kuang tla rak tuah cia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain ziangvek in na rak tuah cia ṭheh khalle meisa in a lo ur that thotho ding; a si lole ral kut in na thi thotho ding. Kharbok ih piat ṭhehmi thlaikho bangin na cemfai thotho ding. Kharbok bangin karhzai dingah zuam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sumtuah pawl tla cu van ih arsi hnakin tam sawn na rak nei naón atu ahcun an um nawn lo. An thla pharh tahrat in a zuang hlomi kharbok vekin an hlo zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na bawi upa pawl cu khawsik ni ah phar parih a bokmi kharbok bangtuk an si. Asinain ni a hung suah tikah cun an zam hlo ih khuitawk ah an feh ti zohman in an thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maw Assiria siangpahrang, na ram uktu pawl an thi, na hrin upa pawl cu kumkhua in an it that zo! Na minung pawl tlangpar ah ṭhekdarh an si ṭheh ih zohman inn ih a rak hruai kirtu ding an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na tuahmawh hma cu dam theinak a um lo; thihpi tlak hma sia a si. Siatsuahnak na ton thu a theitu hmuahhmuah in an lungawi in an zaa an beeng. Zaangfahnak nei loih mi na tisiat ringringnak ihsin a luattu zotal an um maw?
  </para>
</usx>
